date-released: 2026-06-14
url: "https://github.com/dragonwang725-design/agi
abstract: >
  This work formalizes the Necessity of the Receptive Pole Theorem, proving that any generative reasoning system without an independent external fact-receiving channel (Receptive Pole R = ∅) will structurally produce ungrounded judgments (LLM hallucinations).
  The TDA three-layer dialectical architecture separates Active Pole (generative inference, creativity) and Receptive Pole (independent factual snapshot loading), with additional conflict arbitration and human objective governance layers to reconcile determinism and generative capability.
